---`options` is a concatenated string of option characters:
---
---  - horizontal alignment:
---    - 'c' = center
---    - 'r' = right
---  - vertical alignment:
---    - 'a' = ascender
---    - 't' = top
---    - 'v' = vertical center
---    - 'x' = baseline
---    - 'b' = bottom
---    - 'd' = descender
---  - decorations:
---    - 'o' = black outline
---    - 'O' = white outline
---    - 's' = shadow
---  - other:
---    - 'n' = don't round vertex coords to nearest integer (font may get blurry)
---
